    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as lil slime dude Celex Wallacin, and run, climb, and celling fling your way through this challenging precision platformer in early development</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Currently 35 Levels of fast paced platforming action. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Easy and accessible main levels with challenging side paths and brutally placed collectables makes a fun experience for all skill levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Simple to learn, hard to master, the controls are quick to learn so starting the game is easy as (placeholder easy thing)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Respawns are quick and painless allowing you to keep playing without the fear of death... unless you lose all 1000 of your lives &gt;:D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck, have a swell time yo </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features in development</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Level Selector</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Time trials</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- The rest of the\u00a0 actual game</p>",
